ifornia Police Search My Phone During a Traffic Stop? Here\u2019s What the Law Says", "section": "Key Points", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://thewrangler.com/can-california-police-search-my-phone-during-a-traffic-stop-heres-what-the-law-says/", "title": "Can California Police Search My Phone During a Traffic Stop? Here\u2019s What the Law Says", "section": "What Should You Do If Asked?", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://thewrangler.com/can-california-police-search-my-phone-during-a-traffic-stop-heres-what-the-law-says/", "title": "Can California Police Search My Phone During a Traffic Stop? Here\u2019s What the Law Says", "section": "Legal Precedent", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://thewrangler.com/can-california-police-search-my-phone-during-a-traffic-stop-heres-what-the-law-says/", "title": "Can California Police Search My Phone During a Traffic Stop? Here\u2019s What the Law Says", "section": "Sources", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://thewrangler.com/can-california-police-search-my-phone-during-a-traffic-stop-heres-what-the-law-says/", "title": "Can California Police Search My Phone During a Traffic Stop? Here\u2019s What the Law Says", "section": "Key Right", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://thewrangler.com/can-california-police-search-my-phone-during-a-traffic-stop-heres-what-the-law-says/", "title": "Can California Police Search My Phone During a Traffic Stop? Here\u2019s What the Law Says", "section": "Key Right", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://thewrangler.com/can-california-police-search-my-phone-during-a-traffic-stop-heres-what-the-law-says/", "title": "Can California Police Search My Phone During a Traffic Stop? Here\u2019s What the Law Says", "section": "Key Right", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://thewrangler.com/can-california-police-search-my-phone-during-a-traffic-stop-heres-what-the-law-says/", "title": "Can California Police Search My Phone During a Traffic Stop? Here\u2019s What the Law Says", "section": "Key Right", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Traffic Control", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Solid Red Light", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Red Arrow", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Flashing Red Light", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Solid Yellow Light", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Yellow Arrow", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Flashing Yellow Light", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Flashing Yellow Arrow", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Solid Green Light", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Green Arrow", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Traffic Light Not Working", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "WALK or Walking Person", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Don\u2019t Walk or Raised Hand", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Flashing Don\u2019t Walk or Flashing Raised Hand", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Numbers", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Diagonal Crossing", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Sounds", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Pedestrian Push Button", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "No Pedestrian Signals", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Signs", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "STOP Sign", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Red YIELD Sign", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Red and White Regulatory Sign", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "WRONG WAY Sign", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Red Circle with a Red Line Through It", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Yellow and Black Circular Sign or X-shaped Sign", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "5-sided Sign", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Diamond-shaped Sign", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "White Rectangular Sign", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Warning Signs", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Right-of-Way Rules: Who Goes First?", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Intersections", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Roundabouts", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Pedestrians", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Crosswalks", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Pedestrians who are Blind", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-rules-of-the-road/", "title": "California Driver\u2019s Handbook", "section": "Mountain Roads", "type": "knowledge_base"}, {"url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/california-driver-handbook/laws-and-r